    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"AKU is improving standards of postgraduate medical training in Pakistan and some of its graduates are in key positions on the Faculty of the College of Physicians and Surgeons\", said Professor Sultan M. Farooqui, President. College of Physicians and Surgeons of Pakistan (CPSP). Professor Sultan was the chief guest at the Graduation Ceremony for fellows, residents and interns organized by the Department of Postgraduate Medical Education (PGME) of TIle Aga Khan University (AKU) on October 23.1999.",
